Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.95,CN_0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}很久以前，一位少女的歌声，被封进了水晶球里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Long ago, a girl's singing voice was sealed inside a crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:12.30,CN_0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}只有唱完一整首歌，她才能重新回到这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:12.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Only by singing one whole song could she return to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.58,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}你不必把沉默解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}You don't have to explain your silence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:22.89,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}也不必证明伤口曾经痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:22.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}nor prove the wound once hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:26.55,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}把手放在这里听一听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:26.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Lay your hand right here and listen —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:30.53,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}两颗心能唱同一种风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:30.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}two hearts can sing the selfsame wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:33.90,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}咚，是我的木头心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:33.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Thump — that's my wooden heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.51,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}嗒，是你落下的音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}tap — that's the note you let fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.78,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}走错拍也没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}It's all right to miss a beat;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.27,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}我会等你再数一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}I'll wait for you to count again: one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:47.58,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}借我一小段旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:47.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Lend me just a little melody,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:52.07,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}哪怕只有一声呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:52.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}even if it's only a single breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:01:01.26,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}你听，我们已经在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:01:01.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}Listen — we're already together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:12.90,CN_1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}我回来了……谢谢你，一直在听。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:12.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}I'm back... Thank you for listening all along.
